  "body": "### Summary\nAs a respondent who leaves my HFR pseudo, I want to know what is kept, why, for how long, and how to have it deleted.\n\n### Scope\n- Short text shown above the optional pseudo field.\n- Detailed page: controller, purpose, data collected, retention period, deletion right and contact.\n- Controller and contact: Bruno Arene, ezzz75@gmail.com.\n- What the form does not collect: no IP kept beyond anti-abuse, no third-party cookie, no audience measurement.\n\n### Deliverable\n`docs/ux/questionnaire/donnees.md` (French).\n\n### Model and review\nOpus author, Fable review, PO validation. Brief: `docs/ux/cadrage-agents-questionnaire.md` §3, UX-06.\n\nTracked on #628.\n\n### Before you start\n\nRead, in order: `AGENTS.md`, `docs/agents/ORCHESTRATION.md`, `docs/agents/LESSONS.md`, then `docs/ux/README.md`. The UX documents are in French. Until the docs PR is merged into `dev-swift`, read them on branch `docs/ux-questionnaire`.\n\nRules: no proposal the PO classed **Non** may appear in the survey (`docs/ux/tri-m5-decisions.md` §3.5 and §4.7). The reader keeps the WebView: the survey only shows improvements possible with it. Stop and report if an instruction contradicts the plan.\n\n---\n_Opened with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code) for the PO (Bruno), 2026-11-07._\n\n",
